# Jest unit tests and their fixtures live inside LWC bundle directories
# (force-app/main/default/lwc/*/__tests__/), which is the standard LWC jest
# convention -- but Salesforce's metadata deploy walks the whole bundle
# directory and tries to parse everything in it as component source, so a
# .test.js file or a fixture .json/.md file under __tests__/ fails the
# deploy outright ("Invalid LWC imported identifier", "Invalid suffix").
# These were never a problem before this repo had jest tests to ignore.
**/__tests__/**

# Standard Node tooling noise, in case it's ever present locally.
**/node_modules/**
**/coverage/**
**/__pycache__/**
